# W174 (2026-11-24): clean-archive replay of W172's real gphoto2 consumer write

Author replay from committed bytes, NOT an independent witness verdict.
Grade unchanged at rung 4. All paths below are relative to the repo root
unless stated; the replay tree /tmp/w174-lgp is a throwaway directory.

## Clean inputs

  git archive 833729ad reports/frontier-libgphoto2shell.md \
    lab/frontier/libgphoto2shell | tar -x -C /tmp/w174-lgp
  115 files in archive
  cd /tmp/w174-lgp
  sha256sum -c lab/frontier/libgphoto2shell/PINS.sha256
    pins/fix-6a3393d.patch: OK
    pins/jl2005c.c.fixed: OK
    pins/jl2005c.c.vuln: OK
    pins/jl2005c.h.vuln: OK

The release tarball is a provisioned artifact, not a Git file; the copy used
was hashed against the recorded pin:
  sha256 src/libgphoto2-2.5.34.tar.bz2
    5df9e774eb4ab6087a193afff84dcafe9f666e3443fe29e73e6779f659ff7f28

From T=/tmp/w174-lgp/lab/frontier/libgphoto2shell:
  mkdir -p src && cp <repo>/.../src/libgphoto2-2.5.34.tar.bz2 src/
  tar -xjf src/libgphoto2-2.5.34.tar.bz2 -C src
  mv src/libgphoto2-2.5.34 src/libgphoto2-2.5.34-plain
  cd src/libgphoto2-2.5.34-plain
