  Guards are causal; the same API write aborts without them.

C23 safe input M2SHELL_JL2005_COUNT=100, guards=4:
  GP_CAMERA_INIT rc=0; CONSUMER_SKIP no victim; NORMAL_RETURN_COMPLETE

D23 zero pointer/size M2SHELL_VUSB_DATA=0 M2SHELL_VUSB_SIZE=0, guards=4:
