  CONSUMER_GET rc=0 data=(nil) size=0x0
  DEREF_SKIP no usable pointer; NORMAL_RETURN_COMPLETE
  save file 0 bytes

E23 fixed camlib: apply ../../pins/fix-6a3393d.patch in the source tree,
  CFLAGS='-O0 -g -fPIC -fno-omit-frame-pointer' make -j4 && make install:
  only the 16 one-byte handshake reads and the 512-byte block, no
