## Scope

Clean-archive replay removes the "working-tree-only artifact" gap for W172.
It is still an author replay using a lab-patched vusb port, synthetic replies,
a lab-placed victim/guards, a probe-supplied pointer and gdb-restored canary
and saved registers. No physical USB, USB/IP, wire request from a remote
party, device-only canary recovery, command execution or witness verdict.
Rung 4 only; rung 5 UNKNOWN. Per-run raw logs A23.log..F23.log live in the
throwaway replay tree, not in Git; the figures above are copied from them.
